  (text "18650 (J202) -> TP4056 charger, protected, USB-C (J203) -> slide switch SW201 -> MT3608 boost set to 5.0 V (J204)
-> 5V_BOOST, cable 2 pins 1 and 3 -> Schottky D101 on MIDDLE -> 5V_SYS (ESP32 5V pin, RDM6300, SD module,
buzzer option via JP1). 3V3 comes from the ESP32-S3 board regulator and goes to OLED, DS3231, LEDs/buzzer side.
USB on the ESP32 (about 5 V) wins against the battery path (about 4.7 V after the diode).
BAT- is NOT ground: it sits behind the TP4056 protection chip; OUT- (J203 pin 4) is the system ground."
    (at 425 350 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid 1f6636e2-f040-42fa-8f3c-4f54cd8e490d)
  )
  (text "ESP32-S3 GPIO MAP" (at 425 382 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold))
    (uuid 30a7e5e4-1976-41cb-89d1-eaf67ade0576)
  )
  (text "GPIO1 green LED, GPIO2 red LED, GPIO5 power LED (220 ohm each), GPIO42 buzzer transistor (1 k)
GPIO8 SCL / GPIO9 SDA: OLED + DS3231 (I2C)    GPIO10 CS, 11 SCK, 12 MOSI, 13 MISO: microSD (SPI)
GPIO18 <- RDM6300 TX (9600 baud, 3.2 V level)    GPIO40 button 1 (session), GPIO41 button 2 (info)"
    (at 425 388 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid d566c58c-9af2-4f22-b8bc-c2d56248ad76)
  )
  (text "REFERENCES" (at 425 408 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold))
    (uuid a8591760-3988-4ca6-8233-06efcf3a88fe)
  )
  (text "TOP 1-99, MIDDLE 101-199, BOTTOM 201-299: identical to the per-board schematics (sas_schematics)
and to the three PCBs (sas_pcb). H* are the M3 mounting holes of each board."
    (at 425 414 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)))
    (uuid 3ca5d7ce-62e7-4b26-a7d1-5daebb85312a)
  )

